            "detailed_description": "<h1>Our games you might like</h1><p></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/730620/extras/495b9d90589318f69241ab7b5db5b646.avif?t=1786244279\" width=1232 height=706 /></span><br><br><strong>Hammer 2 is an action game in the third person where you will incarnate Hammer a hero of modern times! Take your rifle and kill anyone who gets in your way!</strong><br><br>Take up arms and kill anyone who gets in your way! Use the land and vehicles to your advantage during your missions! To make a perfect score, you will have to: get the highest score, complete the mission in a specific time, and find the secret package!<br><br><strong><i>Can you kill all the enemies and finish the game 100%?</i></strong><br><br><strong>Features :</strong><br><br>■ A unique design!<br>■ More than 30 crazy missions!<br>■ 10 successes to unlock in game!<br>■ Many vehicles to build!<br>■ A completely destructible map!<br>■ Various weapons for even more carnage!<br>■ A multitude of enemies to fight!<br>■ Ambient music to immerse you in the action!<br>■ An addictive gameplay!",
